{"seq":2,"slug":"triplet-loss","title":"三元组与难例挖掘：相对次序才是检索的语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metric-learning-embeddings/losses/triplet-loss","wordCount":1423,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"三元组与难例挖掘-相对次序才是检索的语言\">三元组与难例挖掘：相对次序才是检索的语言</h1><p>对比损失盯的是绝对距离——同类要多近、异类要多远。但检索真正在乎的其实是<strong>相对次序</strong>：查询和它的正确答案，要比和任何错误答案更近，至于近到多少的绝对值并不重要。三元组损失（triplet loss）正是把这个直觉写成公式。它是 FaceNet（2015）刷爆人脸验证的功臣，也把度量学习的成败牢牢绑在一个词上：采样。本篇讲清三元组的机制，以及为什么&quot;怎么挑三元组&quot;比&quot;用什么损失&quot;还重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-锚点-正-负与间隔\">核心概念：锚点、正、负与间隔</h2><p>一个三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a, p, n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 由锚点 anchor、正样本 positive（与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 同类）、负样本 negative（与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 异类）组成。三元组损失要求锚点离正样本比离负样本近至少一个间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = \\max\\big(0,\\; D(a,p) - D(a,n) + m\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(a,n) &gt; D(a,p) + m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>，损失就是零——这个三元组已经&quot;排对了序&quot;，网络不再理它。梯度只来自那些<strong>违反次序</strong>的三元组（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(a,p)+m &gt; D(a,n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）。这带来一个致命现实：训练进行到一定程度后，随机抽的三元组绝大多数都已满足约束、梯度为零，网络&quot;学不动&quot;了。于是三元组损失的核心问题，从&quot;损失长什么样&quot;变成了&quot;如何持续喂给它有梯度的困难三元组&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>三元组类型</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>梯度</th>\n<th>训练价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单（easy）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(a,n) &gt; D(a,p)+m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>无，浪费算力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半难（semi-hard）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(a,p) &lt; D(a,n) &lt; D(a,p)+m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>高，稳定收敛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>难（hard）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(a,n) &lt; D(a,p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>高但易致训练崩溃</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[锚点 a] --&gt; B[正样本 p 同类]&#10;    A --&gt; C[负样本 n 异类]&#10;    B --&gt; D[计算 D_ap]&#10;    C --&gt; E[计算 D_an]&#10;    D --&gt; F{D_an 大于 D_ap 加 m ?}&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|是, 已排对| G[损失=0&lt;br/&gt;简单三元组, 跳过]&#10;    F --&gt;|否, 违反次序| H[损失 = D_ap - D_an + m&lt;br/&gt;产生梯度, 拉近 p 推远 n]\">flowchart TD\n    A[锚点 a] --&gt; B[正样本 p 同类]\n    A --&gt; C[负样本 n 异类]\n    B --&gt; D[计算 D_ap]\n    C --&gt; E[计算 D_an]\n    D --&gt; F{D_an 大于 D_ap 加 m ?}\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|是, 已排对| G[损失=0&lt;br/&gt;简单三元组, 跳过]\n    F --&gt;|否, 违反次序| H[损失 = D_ap - D_an + m&lt;br/&gt;产生梯度, 拉近 p 推远 n]</pre><h2 id=\"难例挖掘-把算力花在刀刃上\">难例挖掘：把算力花在刀刃上</h2><p>既然简单三元组毫无价值，就该主动去找困难的。这就是<strong>难例挖掘</strong>（hard mining），也是三元组方法工程量最大的部分。最激进的&quot;最难负例挖掘&quot;总选全局最难的负样本，但它对标注噪声极敏感——一个标错的样本会被当成&quot;超级难负例&quot;反复拉扯，导致训练崩溃或坍缩到坏解。FaceNet 提出的折中是<strong>半难负例挖掘</strong>（semi-hard）：在&quot;比正样本远、但还没远出间隔&quot;的区间里挑负样本，既有梯度又不至于太极端，训练稳得多。</p>\n<p>一个高效实现是 <strong>batch-hard</strong>：不预先离线挑三元组，而是构造每个批次时保证每个身份有若干样本（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 个身份 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 张图），然后在批内为每个锚点在线选最难的正样本和最难的负样本。这把挖掘从昂贵的全局搜索变成廉价的批内操作，是行人重识别（ReID）领域的标准做法。批次该怎么按身份分组构造，见 <a href=\"../practice/metric-learning-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超越单个三元组-n-pair-与-lifted-structured\">超越单个三元组：N-pair 与 Lifted Structured</h2><p>单个三元组每次只用一个负样本，信息利用率低。两个经典改进把&quot;一个锚点对多个负样本&quot;写进损失。<strong>N-pair loss</strong> 让锚点同时对抗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个来自不同类别的负样本，形式上就退化成了一个 softmax——这已经和 <a href=\"contrastive-loss\">对比损失</a>里的 InfoNCE 惊人地相似，只是负样本来自不同类而非整批。<strong>Lifted Structured loss</strong> 更进一步，把一个批次内所有的正负对关系一次性&quot;提升&quot;进损失，用 log-sum-exp 软性地聚合所有困难负样本，相当于在批内做了一次隐式的难例挖掘。这条演化线的终点，正是用类代理彻底取代样本负例的 <a href=\"proxy-based\">基于代理的损失</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三元组损失的几何副作用\">三元组损失的几何副作用</h2><p>三元组损失只约束相对次序，不约束绝对尺度，这带来一个几何后果：若不做 L2 归一化，网络可以通过整体放大嵌入范数来&quot;轻松&quot;拉开距离差，而非真正学到判别结构。因此三元组几乎总是配 L2 归一化，把嵌入按到超球面上，让间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 有稳定语义——归一化如何改变距离与梯度，见 <a href=\"../geometry/normalization-temperature\">归一化与温度</a>。此外，过度激进的难例挖掘会诱发类内坍缩，与 <a href=\"../geometry/dimensionality-collapse\">维度坍缩</a>讨论的失败模式相通。评估这些嵌入好不好，别看训练损失，要看 <a href=\"../practice/evaluation-metrics\">评估 (Recall@K)</a>里的检索指标。</p>\n<p>采样策略的选择决定训练成败，值得单独对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挖掘策略</th>\n<th>选负样本的依据</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机</td>\n<td>任取</td>\n<td>后期几乎全简单、梯度为零</td>\n<td>不推荐单独使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最难（hard）</td>\n<td>全局最难的负样本</td>\n<td>梯度大但对标注噪声极敏感</td>\n<td>噪声低、需谨慎调节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半难（semi-hard）</td>\n<td>比正样本远但在间隔内</td>\n<td>稳定，FaceNet 采用</td>\n<td>通用默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>batch-hard</td>\n<td>批内为每锚点选最难正负例</td>\n<td>廉价在线，ReID 标准</td>\n<td>按身份分组的批次</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三元组损失约束相对次序：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(0, D(a,p)-D(a,n)+m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，只有违反次序的三元组才有梯度。</li>\n<li>训练后期简单三元组占绝大多数、梯度为零，故难例挖掘是成败关键。</li>\n<li>半难挖掘比最难挖掘稳（后者对噪声敏感易崩）；batch-hard 把挖掘变成廉价的批内在线操作。</li>\n<li>N-pair、Lifted Structured 让一个锚点对抗多个负样本，是通往代理损失的中间站；三元组几乎总配 L2 归一化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"contrastive-loss\">对比损失</a> — 绝对距离视角的姊妹损失</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"proxy-based\">基于代理的损失</a> — 用类代理终结采样问题</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../recommender-systems/deep-learning/embedding-recall\">推荐系统 · 嵌入召回</a> — 三元组式召回在推荐中的应用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"三元组与难例挖掘：相对次序才是检索的语言","id":"三元组与难例挖掘-相对次序才是检索的语言"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：锚点、正、负与间隔","id":"核心概念-锚点-正-负与间隔"},{"level":2,"text":"难例挖掘：把算力花在刀刃上","id":"难例挖掘-把算力花在刀刃上"},{"level":2,"text":"超越单个三元组：N-pair 与 Lifted Structured","id":"超越单个三元组-n-pair-与-lifted-structured"},{"level":2,"text":"三元组损失的几何副作用","id":"三元组损失的几何副作用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"对比损失：同类相吸，异类相斥","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metric-learning-embeddings/losses/contrastive-loss"},"next":{"title":"基于代理的损失：让类代理终结采样噩梦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metric-learning-embeddings/losses/proxy-based"}}